{"record_id": "speech_0000", "video_id": "wifi_troubleshooting_speech", "modality": "speech", "start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 10.0, "text": "这段影片要介绍,当手机无法连接WiFi时,可以如何进行基本故障排除。", "source_file": "outputs/audio/wifi_troubleshooting_speech.wav", "metadata": {"language": "zh", "model": "small"}}
{"record_id": "speech_0001", "video_id": "wifi_troubleshooting_speech", "modality": "speech", "start_seconds": 10.0, "end_seconds": 20.0, "text": "首先,打开手机的设定,进入WiFi页面,确认WiFi功能是否已经开启。", "source_file": "outputs/audio/wifi_troubleshooting_speech.wav", "metadata": {"language": "zh", "model": "small"}}
{"record_id": "speech_0002", "video_id": "wifi_troubleshooting_speech", "modality": "speech", "start_seconds": 20.0, "end_seconds": 33.0, "text": "如果WiFi已经开启,但手机仍然无法连线,可以先关闭WiFi,等待几秒钟后,再重新开启。", "source_file": "outputs/audio/wifi_troubleshooting_speech.wav", "metadata": {"language": "zh", "model": "small"}}
{"record_id": "speech_0003", "video_id": "wifi_troubleshooting_speech", "modality": "speech", "start_seconds": 33.0, "end_seconds": 43.0, "text": "接着,选择想要连接的WiFi网路,点选网路名称,等待手机尝试连线。", "source_file": "outputs/audio/wifi_troubleshooting_speech.wav", "metadata": {"language": "zh", "model": "small"}}
{"record_id": "speech_0004", "video_id": "wifi_troubleshooting_speech", "modality": "speech", "start_seconds": 43.0, "end_seconds": 50.0, "text": "连线完成后,确认手机是否成功连上WiFi。", "source_file": "outputs/audio/wifi_troubleshooting_speech.wav", "metadata": {"language": "zh", "model": "small"}}
{"record_id": "speech_0005", "video_id": "wifi_troubleshooting_speech", "modality": "speech", "start_seconds": 50.0, "end_seconds": 64.0, "text": "如果重新连线后,问题仍然存在,可以进一步检查无线路由器是否正常运作,或是尝试重新启动手机。", "source_file": "outputs/audio/wifi_troubleshooting_speech.wav", "metadata": {"language": "zh", "model": "small"}}
{"record_id": "speech_0006", "video_id": "wifi_troubleshooting_speech", "modality": "speech", "start_seconds": 64.0, "end_seconds": 73.0, "text": "以上就是手机无法连接WiFi时,可以进行的基本故障排除步骤。", "source_file": "outputs/audio/wifi_troubleshooting_speech.wav", "metadata": {"language": "zh", "model": "small"}}
{"record_id": "speech_0007", "video_id": "wifi_troubleshooting_speech", "modality": "speech", "start_seconds": 73.0, "end_seconds": 75.0, "text": "谢谢大家!", "source_file": "outputs/audio/wifi_troubleshooting_speech.wav", "metadata": {"language": "zh", "model": "small"}}
